          <a href="#weight-loss-context" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">9. What This Means if You Are Exercising to Lose Weight</a>
          <a href="#machine-matters" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">10. Does the Treadmill Itself Make a Difference?</a>
          <a href="#verdict" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">11. The Bottom Line on Treadmill Calories</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">12. Frequently Asked Questions</a>
        </nav>
